# Measurements for homoiconic-q59.61 (the boot byte-form limit), morphie, Cloud Hypervisor 54.0,
# 2026-11-24 (UTC). Image: tree 967c95c (limit still 16 MiB) built to ~/hom-967c95c-measure,
# booted through unikernel/given.sh (one processor, 512 MiB), default words (budget 100000000,
# 1 level) unless named. "lit" is `82 02` then the data: a program whose answer is the data.
# Peak memory is ru_maxrss of reflect-linux on the same bytes. Times are wall-clock in the image,
# mostly the serial port writing the answer.

